#: src/main.glade:423 src/onboarding.glade:111
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis Mbukak Kunci"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktifake otentikasi pasuryan supaya otomatis mbukak kunci kunci mlebu "
"utawa KWallet nalika mlebu. Iki kanthi aman nyimpen tembung sandhi sin"
"g disegel ing TPM yen kasedhiya, utawa dienkripsi nganggo AES-256-GCM "
"nggunakake kunci master mung root. Setelan autentikasi pasuryan PAM_AU"
"THTOK kanggo pam_gnome_keyring utawa pam_kwallet5 gumantung ing deskto"
"p sampeyan."

